                "retweet_count": 678,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "For instance, @WSJ alleges that veterans are \u201cwaiting longer to get treatment in North Texas.\u201d They provided zero evidence of this claim other than hearsay. When we asked WSJ to name the specific VA facility & the specific wait-time data they were referencing so we could look into it, WSJ could not provide the info. \n4/",
